<title>USA: NYSE UNAVAILABLES.</title>
<headline>NYSE UNAVAILABLES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Monday that Corimon SACA and Ikon Office Solutions Inc were unavailable for after-hours trading.</p>
<p>Earlier in the day, Ikon Office reported a second-quarter operating profit of $0.37 a share against $0.53 for the same period last year.</p>
</text>
